@prefix backlog: <http://example.org/backlog#> .
@prefix ex:      <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage#> .
@prefix owl:     <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs:    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix dcterms: <http://purl.org/dc/terms/> .

<http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage> a owl:Ontology ;
    rdfs:label "Urgent narrow lineage: SEN0414 chapters 10 and 11, one code, one environment"@en ;
    owl:versionInfo "1.40.0" ; owl:versionIRI <http://example.org/sen0414-ch1011simp-lineage/1.40.0> ; dcterms:identifier "sen0414_ch1011simp_lineage" ;
    rdfs:comment """1.40.0 (2026-11-24): The exam results story is done. Honest note: versions 1.38.0 and 1.39.0 (groom and start) were committed together, which is two stages in one commit."""@en .

ex:TK11_ExamResults_Template backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Page template 9.54.0 (script template_patch_v9_54_0.py over 9.53.7, new code in template_results_v9_54_0.js): a new Exam results tab holds the list of attempts, the review of any attempt and the optional result file and hand-in zip; the Mock exam tab only starts and takes an exam; the release code and its check are removed; student number, name and surname are optional. Defects found by the browser and the test on the way, all fixed: a second element with the same timer id when a result was open while a new exam ran; the saving of a result file was never written to the audit log (in 9.19.0 too, because the handler stopped the later one); the About text did not name the results tab." .
ex:TK11_ExamResults_Pages backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Chapter 10 page 9.24.0 and chapter 11 page 9.25.0 built on the new template from new page data; page test 9.41.0 follows the new behaviour (finish opens the result at once, results refused while an exam is open, review read-only, result file with optional details and the page's own marks, audit events, accessibility check over the results tab)." .
ex:TK11_ExamResults_Verify backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Full page tests: chapter 10 page 9.24.0 410 passed, 0 failed, widgets 59 of 59; chapter 11 page 9.25.0 414 passed, 0 failed, widgets 64 of 64; code check 0 findings on both (18 and 19 examples). Two earlier runs failed on test steps still aimed at the old layout and on the duplicate id above; the logs kept are of the passing runs." .
ex:ST11_ExamResults backlog:hasState backlog:Done ;
    backlog:hasAuditNote "Criterion met on chapters 10 and 11. Known limits, stated: (1) other chapters keep their old pages, with the release lock, until they take the new template; Owner decision needed. (2) The instructor's result desk still issues release codes that no page asks for, and the result file no longer carries the released and release code fields; the desk reads the page's own total, which is still there. (3) Results are kept per browser (a student who opens the page on another computer sees an empty list). (4) The student's attempt list holds the last 40 attempts." .
